The question of spelling!

Hey everyone, I recently came across something in a UNICEF campaign that got me thinking. Some of their posters were printed with the word “speling” instead of “spelling.” Is this a typo, or is it deliberate?

@UNICEF, are you actually telling us that spelling is an optional skill? 😂
